// B1 course (A2 → B1 roadmap), module 5 „Lihtminevik ja kogemused” (a2b1-021…025), stage A2+.
// Lesson template v4 (owner 2026-10-22: „много диктантов и исправления ошибок, разнообразия и ситуаций не хватает”;
// docs/COURSE_DESIGN_COMMUNICATIVE.md §12) — the module's sample. One storyline: a week of the course's friends
// (Markus, Anna, Jaan, Sofia, Liis, Viktor) and one goal, said on the first sheet: at the end the learner writes a
// story for the town paper's contest „Minu kõige ootamatum päev” (024 Kasuta, judged by the group).
// Every phase does its job in its own way, a task type at most once a sheet and a drill once a lesson:
//   021 Markus's yesterday — a phone call, Anna's answer, „two truths and a lie”; Liis's cake goes missing
//       (witness cards, the detective's interview, the cake found); Liis was ill — her week, the group chat, a voice
//       message, Monday at work, a long message.
//   022 Anna's slow weekend — her post, Sofia's voice message, a timeline; Viktor's strange week, a dates puzzle,
//       Jaan's surprise party; at the doctor's — when did it start? (role play, a call, a message to the boss).
//   023 a radio report from the Tartu food festival — Jaan's diary, a crossword, „find someone who”; Sofia and Jaan
//       compare their days (information gap); the paper's review, a radio interview, a comment to the organisers.
//   024 Anna's lost bag — predict from the picture, then listen; Sofia's lost key; Viktor on the wrong bus, what
//       happened next; the contest: last year's winner, a plan, the story told, written and sent to the editor.
// Lesson 5 is the module's mini Harno A2 exam (unchanged). The v3 file is in archive/v3/b1/module05.js, the v1 file
// in archive/v1/b1/module05.js.
